type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252981}] :question/id #uuid "ebd022ce-c22d-5a95-8742-a4cebd7fb20b" :question/math-academy-id "q-11880" :question/problem "Calculate the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola ${x}^{2}-6x-2y+19=0.$" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of an upward- or downward-opening parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-h)^{2}=4p(y-k),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nTo write the given equation in this form, we need to group the $x$-terms on the left-hand side and complete the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-6x-2y+19 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-6x & =2y-19 \\\\ (x-3)^{2}-9 & =2y-19 \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =2y-19+9 \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =2y-10 \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =2(y-5) \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =4(\\frac{1}{2})(y-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(h,k)=(3,5).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253518 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31eae523-b822-58ad-84b8-24a8c8c517c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(1,5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250975} {:answer/id #uuid "4f2b65f9-7449-55b0-b80f-012392fc3d56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(5,1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251201} {:answer/id #uuid "9304e5c4-e8bb-560d-b6cf-ca604dd5c635" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-1,5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251811} {:answer/id #uuid "b05869f6-7a5a-5965-a848-de17c17b0be9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-5,-1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252092} {:answer/id #uuid "c38579e0-e067-5179-a6d6-769ac12fe71c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(5,-1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252282}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c38579e0-e067-5179-a6d6-769ac12fe71c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(5,-1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252282} :answer-field/id #uuid "5ff0b7d9-f9c5-51c2-b17a-cf4bb084169d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252977}] :question/id #uuid "75271eed-aac2-5e60-97ce-6705a0cbc81a" :question/math-academy-id "q-11884" :question/problem "Calculate the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola $3{x}^{2}-30x-8y+67=0.$" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of an upward- or downward-opening parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-h)^{2}=4p(y-k),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nTo write the given equation in this form, we need to group the $x$-terms on the left-hand side and complete the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-30x-8y+67 & =0 \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-30x & =8y-67 \\\\ 3[{x}^{2}-10x] & =8y-67 \\\\ 3[(x-5)^{2}-25] & =8y-67 \\\\ 3(x-5)^{2}-75 & =8y-67 \\\\ 3(x-5)^{2} & =8y-67+75 \\\\ 3(x-5)^{2} & =8y+8 \\\\ 3(x-5)^{2} & =8(y+1) \\\\ (x-5)^{2} & =\\frac{8}{3}(y+1) \\\\ (x-5)^{2} & =4(\\frac{2}{3})(y+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(h,k)=(5,-1).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186354395 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f1cb4b5-261a-5efa-8fcc-b76cdafe1ee0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2,-3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352280} {:answer/id #uuid "8acf1963-92c0-55e3-aa51-d43affedb635" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3,4)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352777} {:answer/id #uuid "ce7f71fc-878d-5676-871b-bb5cabb8d391" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-3,2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353357} {:answer/id #uuid "d39bcc56-0980-5cb4-b448-a9671f6b0415" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2,3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353396} {:answer/id #uuid "f2dbb5f9-92f2-56b2-a6b4-72324c06d821" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-3,4)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353688}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce7f71fc-878d-5676-871b-bb5cabb8d391" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-3,2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353357} :answer-field/id #uuid "410a20de-5c8a-58e2-97be-dbf3cd158570" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353928}] :question/id #uuid "2b03beb9-8f72-5245-9a15-2a9bcfedfa5d" :question/math-academy-id "q-85080" :question/problem "Calculate the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola $5{x}^{2}+30x+2y+41=0.$" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of an upward- or downward-opening parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-h)^{2}=4p(y-k),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nTo write the given equation in this form, we need to group the $x$-terms on the left-hand side and complete the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{x}^{2}+30x+2y+41 & =0 \\\\ 5{x}^{2}+30x & =-2y-41 \\\\ 5[{x}^{2}+6x] & =-2y-41 \\\\ 5[(x+3)^{2}-9] & =-2y-41 \\\\ 5(x+3)^{2}-45 & =-2y-41 \\\\ 5(x+3)^{2} & =-2y-41+45 \\\\ 5(x+3)^{2} & =-2y+4 \\\\ 5(x+3)^{2} & =-2(y-2) \\\\ (x+3)^{2} & =-\\frac{2}{5}(y-2) \\\\ (x+3)^{2} & =4(-\\frac{1}{10})(y-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(h,k)=(-3,2).$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Vertex of a Vertical Parabola by Completing the Square"} :step/id #uuid "8b16935b-a6e7-5709-a481-0062ac5d79ca" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172767}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172873 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186173147 :tutorial/content "Suppose we are given the parabola \n\n$$\nx^2 - 4x - 8y - 28 = 0,\n$$\n\nwhose graph is shown below. How can we find the vertex of the parabola?\n\n![](images/28/2849c732102f52d5f7f2e0f5e29724560d4d7052df80e90fe8d24b95911f5092.png)\n\nRecall that the standard equation of a *vertical* parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-h)^2 = 4p(y-k),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is a constant. \n\nTo write our equation in standard form, we group the $x$-terms on the left-hand side and complete the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-4x-8y-28 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-4x & =8y+28 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}-4 & =8y+28 \\\\ (x-2)^{2} & =8y+32 \\\\ (x-2)^{2} & =8(y+4) \\\\ (x-2)^{2} & =4(2)(y-(-4))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(h,k) = ({\\color{blue}2},{\\color{red}-4}).$" :tutorial/id #uuid "57e24d89-1be2-5ee0-bdd5-e0d68dbb8f4d" :tutorial/title "Introduction"} :step/id #uuid "ddfa64c2-aafd-53ab-96b1-81642b939e2c" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172872}}] :activity/title "Calculating the Vertex of a Parabola by Completing the Square" :activity/type {:db/ident :activity.type/lesson} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186172206}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049052 :topic/id #uuid "d5eeaed9-a618-5662-a81f-c1e67aebd8d7" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166806 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166644 :question/id #uuid "f78d6af8-1a67-50e5-a1d0-6afbbe2b7c16" :question/math-academy-id "e-8452" :question/problem "${\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt{2x-x^2}} \\textrm{d}x= }$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n2x-x^2 & = -(x^2 - 2x)\\[5pt]\n& = -(x^2 - 2\\cdot x + 1^2-1^2)\\[5pt]\n& = -((x-1)^2 - 1) \\[5pt]\n&= 1 - (x-1)^2\n}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt{2x-x^2}} \\textrm{d}x  = \\int  \\dfrac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt { 1-(x-1)^2 } }\t\\, \\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u = x-1.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}u}{\\textrm{d}x}=1\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\textrm{d}x = \\textrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt{2x-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt{1-(x-1)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-1)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "280d5568-b89a-5f92-97b1-a0489f139705" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167435 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0aafb802-86f0-5b89-a926-41ff9b53eb26" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538259} {:answer/id #uuid "4ef7868e-725c-539b-b28e-4d383bd7c386" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538399} {:answer/id #uuid "71bc69fb-a846-5e4b-b3dd-1c0493f3cf93" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538485} {:answer/id #uuid "7263808f-4625-51b4-92b6-c4116a2a33ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538490} {:answer/id #uuid "c31853a1-e8da-5202-9065-d951a7fc96c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538685}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c31853a1-e8da-5202-9065-d951a7fc96c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538685} :answer-field/id #uuid "89619ab1-cf6b-55c2-ad27-e9fc5025ae4d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165818}] :question/id #uuid "8c392298-33d9-51cd-a095-a21fc53f8649" :question/math-academy-id "q-95976" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-4x-3}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}-4x-3 & =-({x}^{2}+4x+3) \\\\  & =-({x}^{2}+2\\cdot 2x+{2}^{2}-{2}^{2}+3) \\\\  & =-((x+2)^{2}-1) \\\\  & =1-(x+2)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-4x-3}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{1-(x+2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+2.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-4x-3}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{1-(x+2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167518 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "005434de-0921-503b-a0e7-54592318d301" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538234} {:answer/id #uuid "0b113bca-9912-5f35-96fa-95493e21f318" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538260} {:answer/id #uuid "3609cd87-57e2-52fc-984f-43d3f16611ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538341} {:answer/id #uuid "682ec881-b5df-5663-8b1e-5632a85fd8d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538466} {:answer/id #uuid "6d80edc0-9454-51f1-b687-a8321c5ca78a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538478}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0b113bca-9912-5f35-96fa-95493e21f318" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538260} :answer-field/id #uuid "8e78c2b7-cba3-5a4d-950c-d6f7840d0864" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186166316}] :question/id #uuid "7347b447-f057-5855-9436-49c47183f8c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-97776" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{(x-1)\\sqrt{4+2x-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+2x+4 & =-({x}^{2}-2x-4) \\\\  & =-({x}^{2}-2\\cdot x+{1}^{2}-{1}^{2}-4) \\\\  & =-((x-1)^{2}-5) \\\\  & =5-(x-1)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{(x-1)\\sqrt{4+2x-{x}^{2}}} & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{(x-1)\\sqrt{5-{(x-1)}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})\\sqrt{5-5{(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{(x-1)\\sqrt{4+2x-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot \\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-1}{\\sqrt{5}})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538968 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03a0fc46-b048-5a4e-895a-4978ef9feb4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-5)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538240} {:answer/id #uuid "052a6ce6-06ec-5a50-b5a8-3b1ef0e36408" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-5)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538245} {:answer/id #uuid "06b9e609-4482-5d45-9ff1-d52de7ae485b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-5)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538249} {:answer/id #uuid "87a67db4-88da-5cec-af36-b1f00cf5bec6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-5)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538545} {:answer/id #uuid "ce39a028-f8ca-55ac-ad95-0b53b700d16b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-5)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538710}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "03a0fc46-b048-5a4e-895a-4978ef9feb4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-5)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538240} :answer-field/id #uuid "52950305-513b-5afd-924b-10249cc71603" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538845}] :question/id #uuid "6858ad14-b7bc-531f-aa86-afb1603436a5" :question/math-academy-id "q-97778" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{(3x-15)\\sqrt{10x-{x}^{2}-24}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+10x-24 & =-({x}^{2}-10x+24) \\\\  & =-({x}^{2}-2\\cdot 5x+{5}^{2}-{5}^{2}+24) \\\\  & =-((x-5)^{2}-1) \\\\  & =1-(x-5)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{(3x-15)\\sqrt{10x-{x}^{2}-24}}\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-5)\\sqrt{1-(x-5)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-5.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(3x-15)\\sqrt{10x-{x}^{2}-24}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-5)\\sqrt{1-(x-5)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-5)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538975 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d297ab5-0b5b-5898-9d00-049ef4f0cdd6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538435} {:answer/id #uuid "6e23005c-3e43-5f81-95b0-064d6f1cc2e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538480} {:answer/id #uuid "88534066-9464-51b3-80f8-1c66795db01c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538547} {:answer/id #uuid "99b4efe7-35db-550c-a5bc-0c864f8b750b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538595} {:answer/id #uuid "99ce5c3b-4565-52c4-ae07-333125778d34" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538596}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "88534066-9464-51b3-80f8-1c66795db01c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538547} :answer-field/id #uuid "4cf1c834-9e01-515c-863e-f0e8a28383ad" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538844}] :question/id #uuid "726516a6-793d-5373-8298-c27b8c843f27" :question/math-academy-id "q-97766" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{-4{x}^{2}-8x}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4{x}^{2}-8x & =-4({x}^{2}+2x) \\\\  & =-4({x}^{2}+2\\cdot x+{1}^{2}-{1}^{2}) \\\\  & =-4[(x+1)^{2}-1] \\\\  & =4[1-(x+1)^{2}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{-4{x}^{2}-8x}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{4[1-(x+1)^{2}]}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{1-(x+1)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+1.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{-4{x}^{2}-8x}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{1-(x+1)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539018 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "238150d5-412c-5e4f-8ec7-0e1a8fc47b07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538304} {:answer/id #uuid "682c1810-2a8d-5ae9-ab98-90e3455933f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538465} {:answer/id #uuid "954d732f-c8a8-5401-9ea5-cff879834dee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538582} {:answer/id #uuid "b1d2650d-b9f4-5aa7-8e6f-ae3401a2951c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538648} {:answer/id #uuid "c4f80582-298f-5c90-a10b-ebd361c7f1f1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538688}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "682c1810-2a8d-5ae9-ab98-90e3455933f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538465} :answer-field/id #uuid "df0b2a58-e387-57a4-9854-4e28d5375adf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538907}] :question/id #uuid "e0181c3f-486e-569d-aaa1-064715b86f7e" :question/math-academy-id "q-97762" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{4x-{x}^{2}-3}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x-{x}^{2}-3 & =-({x}^{2}-4x+3) \\\\  & =-({x}^{2}-2\\cdot 2x+{2}^{2}-{2}^{2}+3) \\\\  & =-((x-2)^{2}-1) \\\\  & =1-(x-2)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{4x-{x}^{2}-3}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{1-(x-2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-2.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{4x-{x}^{2}-3}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{1-(x-2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186563720 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0cb145f1-f9ae-5d5e-9acb-c2e8557eb522" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562967} {:answer/id #uuid "259a3844-82ae-5b24-a85f-f38b2f21f870" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563031} {:answer/id #uuid "4e03b87e-8d9e-547f-803e-f3b920ae8222" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563122} {:answer/id #uuid "aa279346-be14-5108-9c91-ebb49fea3432" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563328} {:answer/id #uuid "bb94fb36-58d4-5f5c-9e67-67e40c60505c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563356}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aa279346-be14-5108-9c91-ebb49fea3432" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563328} :answer-field/id #uuid "0526b46b-564d-561d-a9aa-fedc41539160" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563520}] :question/id #uuid "a95ee677-1642-5975-8b50-8432d56de160" :question/math-academy-id "q-97770" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-4x}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}-4x & =-({x}^{2}+4x) \\\\  & =-({x}^{2}+2\\cdot 2x+{2}^{2}-{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =-((x+2)^{2}-4) \\\\  & =4-(x+2)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-4x}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{4-(x+2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{2(x+2)\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x+2}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x+2}{2})\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x+2}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x+2}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=2\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+2)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-4x}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x+2}{2})\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x+2}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186563744 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1065a3b5-7eb0-5108-b4e2-8a64406d6063" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562978} {:answer/id #uuid "39d34837-ebfe-5409-b1ab-da122aa01d5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563075} {:answer/id #uuid "4c246a52-305e-5adb-972f-c828583b7f6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563115} {:answer/id #uuid "7b8de859-a1f8-5dd2-834f-fa91b60b37c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563215} {:answer/id #uuid "b61c450a-f091-5a01-bd84-81b3a853a9d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563347}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39d34837-ebfe-5409-b1ab-da122aa01d5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563075} :answer-field/id #uuid "a1d9e3fb-7750-5a4b-a417-c4a5e9cfd326" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563606}] :question/id #uuid "d6b27f7b-e94e-5d63-abcb-feb8d8bed4dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-97777" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3}{(x+3)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-6x}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}-6x & =-({x}^{2}+6x) \\\\  & =-({x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2}) \\\\  & =-((x+3)^{2}-9) \\\\  & =9-(x+3)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{(x+3)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-6x}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{3}{(x+3)\\sqrt{9-{(x+3)}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x+3}{3})\\sqrt{9-9{(\\frac{x+3}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x+3}{3})\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x+3}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x+3}{3}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=3\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{(x+3)\\sqrt{-{x}^{2}-6x}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{(\\frac{x+3}{3})\\sqrt{1-{(\\frac{x+3}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{3})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Completing the Square to Compute a Hyperbolic Arsecant Integral"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166807 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166645 :question/id #uuid "cde0faf2-8650-59c7-9a28-073516b09594" :question/math-academy-id "e-8453" :question/problem "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{1}{4-(2x-2)^2} \\textrm{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{4-(2x-2)^2}\\textrm{d}x = \n\\int \\dfrac{1}{4-4(x-1)^2}\\textrm{d}x = \n\\dfrac{1}{4} {\\int}\\dfrac{1}{ 1 - (x-1)^2 }\\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u = x-1.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}u}{\\textrm{d}x}=1\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\textrm{d}x = \\textrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(x-1)}^{2}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\operatorname{arcoth}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(x-1)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this result is subject to the condition $\\left|{x-1} \\right| >   1.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4a67a245-b5be-5fe5-b6e4-c4a5f4bee054" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167433 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "179d2d9f-3689-587a-b6a6-dd27260cc293" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538284} {:answer/id #uuid "473cfe94-aab2-5f0a-860b-299dd85f38a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(2x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538380} {:answer/id #uuid "60839b68-ba6a-5ca4-9372-aa8141e0fac8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538444} {:answer/id #uuid "6a5d6620-1229-5c0a-b17a-410aefc033ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538470} {:answer/id #uuid "72d127bd-5e0a-5c74-94ac-2c6909f28a93" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(2x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538492}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "60839b68-ba6a-5ca4-9372-aa8141e0fac8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538444} :answer-field/id #uuid "3fe46489-70af-5d40-a776-89ec3cf12552" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165806}] :question/id #uuid "708d136b-efc4-5e95-bc0c-835335334b0a" :question/math-academy-id "q-95973" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(x-1)\\sqrt{4-(2x-2)^{2}}}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(x-1)\\sqrt{4-(2x-2)^{2}}} & =\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(x-1)\\sqrt{4-4{(x-1)}^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt{1-(x-1)^{2}}}\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-1.$ Then, we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-1)\\sqrt{1-(x-1)^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-1)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167434 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11c72aed-2f1d-591b-bc3b-b752ede408b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{3x-1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538274} {:answer/id #uuid "29890455-6ae9-5148-b652-040930f8a666" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{3x-1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538320} {:answer/id #uuid "7d57b259-4c0c-5d0c-aafc-42e8ea0a1ab3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538518} {:answer/id #uuid "a93b94ff-8a35-57fb-9c5d-28f6c673d961" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3x-1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538632} {:answer/id #uuid "adc66bf6-9610-5424-b2cc-2f08ea59b274" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{3x-1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538641}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "29890455-6ae9-5148-b652-040930f8a666" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{3x-1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538320} :answer-field/id #uuid "0868a8f4-18a1-5876-a50c-b8b68ef0f30e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165812}] :question/id #uuid "277cde94-a375-546d-bd1f-19d53d382abd" :question/math-academy-id "q-95975" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|6x-2|\\sqrt{9+(3x-1)^{2}}}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|6x-2|\\sqrt{9+(3x-1)^{2}}}=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{6|x-\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{9+9{(x-\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{18}\\int \\frac{1}{|x-\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{1+{(x-\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-\\frac{1}{3}.$ Then, we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{18}\\int \\frac{1}{|x-\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{1+{(x-\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{18}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-\\frac{1}{3})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{3x-1}{3})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538926 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "846a8a5f-917a-52ee-8aed-571fe7baf73b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(3x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538536} {:answer/id #uuid "95b988d9-0f78-5bd1-a98b-93f47ac0eec2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538583} {:answer/id #uuid "b74520f3-a453-5525-9973-50557d9b81f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538661} {:answer/id #uuid "c7b139d4-d0e6-5a0b-bd46-0a812e6fd8c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538699} {:answer/id #uuid "e9f6082e-4214-5c75-b4b6-a0e478cad0f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538765}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e9f6082e-4214-5c75-b4b6-a0e478cad0f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538765} :answer-field/id #uuid "5b435c31-7ad5-5fce-a19f-e0cb3a0a30ed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538853}] :question/id #uuid "02d58382-8176-5a03-b109-135b67345884" :question/math-academy-id "q-97750" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(x+1)\\sqrt{9-(3x+3)^{2}}}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(x+1)\\sqrt{9-(3x+3)^{2}}} & =\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(x+1)\\sqrt{9-9{(x+1)}^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{1-(x+1)^{2}}}\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+1.$ Then, we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{(x+1)\\sqrt{1-(x+1)^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+1)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538953 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d7c4290-9353-557a-a78e-c9968ff65543" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{3x-2}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538326} {:answer/id #uuid "5ce2b7d3-6d59-59f5-8ebe-05b2e387253e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(3x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538433} {:answer/id #uuid "88bb5d4b-0ce6-53d9-8497-039fb7fe2e2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{3x-2}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538551} {:answer/id #uuid "c0f32036-6948-5f43-a566-222721d70200" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{3x-2}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538681} {:answer/id #uuid "d37f6b69-2bf6-5e33-a159-45bc4b373ce2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538722}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c0f32036-6948-5f43-a566-222721d70200" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{3x-2}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538681} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe2698ca-7e20-5c2e-95df-9f69c77c58a2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538923}] :question/id #uuid "46c80522-dca7-526c-a225-6cc3d9755240" :question/math-academy-id "q-97313" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(6x-4)\\sqrt{9-(3x-2)^{2}}}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{(6x-4)\\sqrt{9-(3x-2)^{2}}}=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{6(x-\\frac{2}{3})\\sqrt{9-9{(x-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{18}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-\\frac{2}{3})\\sqrt{1-{(x-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-\\frac{2}{3}.$ Then, we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{18}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-\\frac{2}{3})\\sqrt{1-{(x-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{18}\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-\\frac{2}{3})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{3x-2}{3})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539016 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e2a94b3-44dd-52b7-9ec8-57361cc9534d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538267} {:answer/id #uuid "5ede2391-c2b2-5c77-84a5-0c2d651d0c65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538441} {:answer/id #uuid "7ecac083-f3f6-50fd-85bd-f274abf8632b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538522} {:answer/id #uuid "8f9a2895-a913-526c-a6b5-9b164f01bfb0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538569} {:answer/id #uuid "c0b5fe7e-e088-5647-ad7c-cb6d53c10815" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538680}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ede2391-c2b2-5c77-84a5-0c2d651d0c65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538441} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f32ba7e-ec4d-5979-a816-0eff8d932fa9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538876}] :question/id #uuid "dbcc5371-79bd-5123-b706-5a10821a5d21" :question/math-academy-id "q-97758" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{4-(x+3)^{2}}\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{4-(x+3)^{2}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{4-4{(\\frac{x+3}{2})}^{2}}\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{x+3}{2})}^{2}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x+3}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=2\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{x+3}{2})}^{2}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{arcoth}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this result is subject to the condition $|\\frac{x+3}{2}|>1.$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Computing an Inverse Reciprocal Hyperbolic Integral Containing a Completed Square"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166808 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166646 :question/id #uuid "26cd55d1-dc94-507c-bcf9-13d619493184" :question/math-academy-id "e-8454" :question/problem "${\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{6}{|3x+9|\\sqrt{x^2+6x+10}} \\textrm{d}x= }$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+6x+10 & ={x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2}+10 \\\\  & =(x+3)^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{6}{|3x\\!+\\!9|\\sqrt{x^2\\!+\\!6x\\!+\\!10}} \\,\\textrm{d}x  = \\int  \\dfrac{6}{3|x\\!+\\!3|\\sqrt {1\\!+\\!(x\\!+\\!3)^2} }\t\\, \\textrm{d}x = {2} \\int \\dfrac{1}{|x\\!+\\!3|\\sqrt{1\\!+\\!(x\\!+\\!3)^2}} \\, \\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u = x+3.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}u}{\\textrm{d}x}=1\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\textrm{d}x = \\textrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}2\\int \\frac{1}{|x+3|\\sqrt{1+(x+3)^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+3)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f97720d6-2c67-5017-bf20-8045a8bb30b5" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167436 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d84557a-483b-5d86-b94d-d4c4b8aaecf2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538264} {:answer/id #uuid "7757ac70-ef61-5e8f-a5b3-02b102e498d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538501} {:answer/id #uuid "9c33e5eb-9dde-5c7c-b414-ba30f3308878" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538604} {:answer/id #uuid "cfc1ea2f-a52f-5330-a42a-047633957a3a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538714} {:answer/id #uuid "eb1b61ae-1e87-535f-8fc0-68cde71649a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538769}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eb1b61ae-1e87-535f-8fc0-68cde71649a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538769} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e8e8330-236a-5ebb-966c-b155b08ffef3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165824}] :question/id #uuid "2e1c2ab8-7185-5af4-9bb5-d9487e392b5e" :question/math-academy-id "q-95977" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{2}{|4x-8|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-4x+5}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-4x+5 & ={x}^{2}-2\\cdot 2x+{2}^{2}-{2}^{2}+5 \\\\  & =(x-2)^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{|4x-8|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-4x+5}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{2}{4|x-2|\\sqrt{1+(x-2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|x-2|\\sqrt{1+(x-2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-2.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|x-2|\\sqrt{1+(x-2)^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167519 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a53a977-08c6-5df9-a860-2371d7ca93a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538428} {:answer/id #uuid "a541d1ea-9725-5c0d-81a6-8717209ba023" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538627} {:answer/id #uuid "ac30b210-151b-52ec-9f43-9946b5b6bd5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538637} {:answer/id #uuid "e5e11cb3-9047-5ff4-947e-2cd0cb49d427" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538755} {:answer/id #uuid "f5fa1e27-e6e7-5ee2-8cfd-06752c595b70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538790}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ac30b210-151b-52ec-9f43-9946b5b6bd5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538637} :answer-field/id #uuid "cffcc18d-04b4-520c-afc2-9502fc33eeb7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186166322}] :question/id #uuid "d0b115b9-4f73-5fd8-99ef-72eedb4e4a17" :question/math-academy-id "q-97903" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{2}{|2x+1|\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}+4x+5}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}+4x+5 & =4({x}^{2}+x+\\frac{5}{4}) \\\\  & =4({x}^{2}+2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}x+{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}-{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{5}{4}) \\\\  & =4[{(x+\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}+1]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2}{|2x+1|\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}+4x+5}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{2}|\\sqrt{4[1+{(x+\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}]}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{2}|\\sqrt{1+{(x+\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+\\frac{1}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{2}|\\sqrt{1+{(x+\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538970 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19c51b78-104c-5cc3-aee1-4e68441c9623" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538292} {:answer/id #uuid "453056a6-3a29-558e-96a3-8e72fe77debe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538372} {:answer/id #uuid "82eda7e3-a9bb-5caf-8d13-aa3068ab29d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538532} {:answer/id #uuid "a5174d35-1a1b-5a59-a41a-cfbded8edbe3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538624} {:answer/id #uuid "d47c671f-daea-5c22-a4cd-9f6d91df90f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538724}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "453056a6-3a29-558e-96a3-8e72fe77debe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538372} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e1629ae-ab1a-568d-929f-d60dc925bde5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538828}] :question/id #uuid "69f3a20c-d1a0-5eb2-90e0-cb5356408eda" :question/math-academy-id "q-97901" :question/problem "$\\int -\\frac{6}{|x+3|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+6x+13}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+6x+13 & ={x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2}+13 \\\\  & =(x+3)^{2}+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int -\\frac{6}{|x+3|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+6x+13}}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\int \\frac{6}{|x+3|\\sqrt{4+(x+3)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\int \\frac{6}{2|\\frac{x+3}{2}|\\sqrt{4+4{(\\frac{x+3}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x+3}{2}|\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{x+3}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x+3}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=2\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x+3}{2}|\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{x+3}{2})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{3}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-3\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+3}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538980 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f21857b-1659-5d21-9156-55464bc5827c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538401} {:answer/id #uuid "5cbbfe99-40b4-5a39-acb5-22411fdbd5b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538432} {:answer/id #uuid "7b11f975-7008-532f-86a6-34c7ddbed852" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538514} {:answer/id #uuid "ebe3d04d-8a52-5a06-8112-4f61eaf69eab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538771} {:answer/id #uuid "fb8e96b0-33c1-525d-a438-9b2176a1d06e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538799}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fb8e96b0-33c1-525d-a438-9b2176a1d06e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538799} :answer-field/id #uuid "8e035c3a-1daf-5a2e-a5be-43c121a2a65e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538875}] :question/id #uuid "87c6c320-8ad0-5a7a-8ea7-78e763a7875c" :question/math-academy-id "q-97781" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3}{|3x+1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}+6x+10}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{x}^{2}+6x+10 & =9({x}^{2}+\\frac{2}{3}x+\\frac{10}{9}) \\\\  & =9({x}^{2}+2\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}x+{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}-{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}+\\frac{10}{9}) \\\\  & =9[{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}+1]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{|3x+1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}+6x+10}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{9[1+{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}]}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{1+{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+\\frac{1}{3}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{1+{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186539028 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "45abf4a2-106d-55be-98fe-a203ed7f3489" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538374} {:answer/id #uuid "650fbbcf-b967-5e75-a0a8-d383d4231cca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538457} {:answer/id #uuid "8a07f14a-602d-5dd1-aeec-f618cd8ac959" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538554} {:answer/id #uuid "b64538dd-a81f-5c56-9eaa-8ba0ac2c899d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538656} {:answer/id #uuid "dabd251e-fae7-5698-83c0-507011d42bdf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538734}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dabd251e-fae7-5698-83c0-507011d42bdf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538734} :answer-field/id #uuid "59703bd9-6018-583d-92ce-e008586da72f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538852}] :question/id #uuid "fa581feb-4c4c-5d1e-ad5b-763e0315938f" :question/math-academy-id "q-97780" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{4}{|x+1|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+2x+5}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+2x+5 & ={x}^{2}+2\\cdot x+{1}^{2}-{1}^{2}+5 \\\\  & =(x+1)^{2}+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{4}{|x+1|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+2x+5}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{4}{|x+1|\\sqrt{4+(x+1)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{2}{|\\frac{x+1}{2}|\\sqrt{4+4{(\\frac{x+1}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x+1}{2}|\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{x+1}{2})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x+1}{2}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=2\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x+1}{2}|\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{x+1}{2})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186563668 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a472c55-b621-565c-b578-f92c20cbb266" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563146} {:answer/id #uuid "6b7d1c78-ae26-55ef-86e8-9c531b3f1a3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563193} {:answer/id #uuid "bf7b4cd4-4878-5393-9a31-5c5c09f3bcdd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563367} {:answer/id #uuid "ddb986c7-c26a-5de1-8745-8a63847438c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563431} {:answer/id #uuid "fba7141a-d135-5744-8bbd-0158aa2f9308" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563508}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fba7141a-d135-5744-8bbd-0158aa2f9308" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563508} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b36eef3-f0c2-5b45-97f7-a2607c73a159" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563522}] :question/id #uuid "38a6fd7f-85a4-5b9d-9914-3bd5a2ab420c" :question/math-academy-id "q-97904" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{|x-5|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-10x+27}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-10x+27 & ={x}^{2}-2\\cdot 5x+{5}^{2}-{5}^{2}+27 \\\\  & =(x-5)^{2}+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{|x-5|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-10x+27}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{|x-5|\\sqrt{2+(x-5)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}}|\\sqrt{2+2{(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}}|\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{|\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}}|\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(\\frac{x-5}{\\sqrt{2}})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186563699 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a909a9b-174b-5639-8410-d7e274a5815f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563147} {:answer/id #uuid "6890919f-3dff-518f-b537-36ec02be3bc0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563186} {:answer/id #uuid "7f16f630-7db7-5f3c-9f65-39971597a4cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563223} {:answer/id #uuid "ba54fe97-ce78-59e0-ba7b-9401d786d8de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563353} {:answer/id #uuid "e66f808f-00b9-5dfa-be64-b5ad0a17a5cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563451}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba54fe97-ce78-59e0-ba7b-9401d786d8de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563353} :answer-field/id #uuid "96a55f92-f39f-5881-94c0-2f84b4c3471a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186563598}] :question/id #uuid "6a55ffae-eeb7-54cf-a5ce-c644ed8a6a5a" :question/math-academy-id "q-97905" :question/problem "$\\int -\\frac{15}{|5x+10|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+4x+5}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+4x+5 & ={x}^{2}+2\\cdot 2x+{2}^{2}-{2}^{2}+5 \\\\  & =(x+2)^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int -\\frac{15}{|5x-10|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+4x+5}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\int \\frac{15}{5|x+2|\\sqrt{1+(x+2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=-3\\int \\frac{1}{|x+2|\\sqrt{1+(x+2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+2.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}-3\\int \\frac{1}{|x+2|\\sqrt{1+(x+2)^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =-3\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+2)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Completing the Square to Compute a Hyperbolic Arcosecant Integral"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166809 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166647 :question/id #uuid "aa11660f-ce84-52df-bcc4-45a6d63b6d7e" :question/math-academy-id "e-8455" :question/problem "$\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{1}{3-2x-x^2} \\textrm{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n3-2x-x^2 & = -(x^2 + 2x - 3)\\[5pt]\n& = -(x^2 + 2\\cdot x +1^2 - 1^2 - 3)\\[5pt]\n& = -((x+1)^2 - 4) \\[5pt]\n&= 4 - (x+1)^2\n}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the denominator of our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{3-2x-x^2}\\textrm{d}x =\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{4-(x+1)^2}\\textrm{d}x = \n\\dfrac{1}{4} {\\int}\\dfrac{1}{ 1 - \\left( \\frac{1}{2}(x+1)\\right)^2 }\\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u = \\dfrac{1}{2}(x+1).$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}u}{\\textrm{d}x}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\textrm{d}x = 2\\,\\textrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{1}{2}(x+1))}^{2}}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{arcoth}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{1}{2}(x+1))+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+1}{2})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this result is subject to the condition $\\left|\\dfrac {x+1} {2} \\right| >   1.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6640d03e-5194-5a31-9315-007e59732446" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167437 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1700c4a5-52d0-5037-8796-caf2ee62ae0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+4}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538283} {:answer/id #uuid "3611fbe1-57c9-53e2-8603-e04f4f8be16d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(x+4)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538342} {:answer/id #uuid "588606f2-b50e-582f-b36f-92ef91f044f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+4}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538421} {:answer/id #uuid "65595378-37db-5a80-bfa3-54226b604247" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+4}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538458} {:answer/id #uuid "7b2b86f9-de8e-5b00-a2c6-4eb089bfc6de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+4}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538516}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1700c4a5-52d0-5037-8796-caf2ee62ae0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+4}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538283} :answer-field/id #uuid "e3ad98b8-75f7-532b-b3de-b7d223439b8f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165830}] :question/id #uuid "2d619ef2-7b28-5e2f-b9a5-764feebd0f07" :question/math-academy-id "q-95978" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{9-(x+4)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{9-(x+4)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{9-9(\\frac{1}{9}(x+4)^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{1}{3}(x+4))}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=\\frac{1}{3}(x+4).$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=3\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{1}{3}(x+4))}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\,\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{9}\\cdot \\operatorname{arcoth}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+4}{3})+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this result is subject to the condition $|\\frac{x+4}{3}|>1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167438 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fbf49c6-7dc7-5262-b85d-d6fa879d4450" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538270} {:answer/id #uuid "808b6e4f-b16c-570c-99c7-b1e3de33c4a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538526} {:answer/id #uuid "b51af6ea-46da-5bba-a5c9-65a857bf09c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{5})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538654} {:answer/id #uuid "bbf230ca-7c00-5a91-b46e-ec016a126ff3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{5})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538675} {:answer/id #uuid "c50775eb-d6ce-5b1a-9822-5f69ba8712d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{5})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538690}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "808b6e4f-b16c-570c-99c7-b1e3de33c4a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\frac{x+2}{\\sqrt{5}})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538526} :answer-field/id #uuid "ef67831